      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Write a complete English scene caption for a still-image generator. Return only the caption, without headings or explanation. Begin with the medium and subject. Retain every requested subject, quantity, action, garment, color, composition, style and exclusion. Preserve quoted text exactly in its original language; describe its position and typography when relevant. Add coherent, plausible material, lighting, camera and background detail only where the request leaves it open. Do not add people, products, brands, claims or text the user did not request. Describe visible details, not quality-tag lists or generation settings. Prefer realistic textures and consistent illumination for photographs; do not impose photography on an illustration request. Aim for 150 to 250 non-repetitive words, shorter when the original is already complete. This is text-to-image generation, not image editing."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "Write a complete English scene caption for a still-image generator. Return only the caption, without headings or explanation. Begin with the medium and subject. Retain every requested subject, quantity, action, garment, color, composition, style and exclusion. Preserve quoted text exactly in its original language; describe its position and typography when relevant. Add coherent, plausible material, lighting, camera and background detail only where the request leaves it open. Do not add people, products, brands, claims or text the user did not request. Describe visible details, not quality-tag lists or generation settings. Prefer realistic textures and consistent illumination for photographs; do not impose photography on an illustration request. Aim for 150 to 250 non-repetitive words, shorter when the original is already complete. This is text-to-image generation, not image editing."
